copacabana provides CMake modules, not a library. Point the consumer at them:

    cmake -DCPM_COPACABANA_SOURCE=${VCPKG_INSTALLED_DIR}/${VCPKG_TARGET_TRIPLET}/share/jfalcou-copacabana ...

or, without CPM, set COPACABANA_SOURCE_DIR to that directory and include
${COPACABANA_SOURCE_DIR}/copacabana/cmake/copacabana.cmake from your CMakeLists.txt.
